<title>USA: Houghton Mifflin says increases div 4.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Houghton Mifflin says increases div 4.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		 $0.125		     $0.12</p>
<p> Pay		   Aug. 27</p>
<p> Record		Aug. 13</p>
<p>Note: Full name of company is Houghton Mifflin Co.</p>
<p>The new dividend is post split.</p>
<p>The company on Wednesday declared a two-for-one split of its common stock, to come in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend. The new annual dividend rate is $0.50 per post-split share. The company said it will pay its 100 percent stock dividend to shareholders of record on July 11, and will be distributed July 25.</p>
</text>
